{"content":"<p>js</p>\n<!-- more -->\n<h2 id=\"_1-判断js类型的方式\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#_1-判断js类型的方式\"><span>1.判断js类型的方式</span></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>typeof() （最常用）\n但是typeof()有时候就贼坑，让人窒息\nnumber、boolean、string、object、undefined、function、symbol</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"language-js line-numbers-mode\" data-ext=\"js\" data-title=\"js\"><button class=\"copy\" title=\"复制代码\" data-copied=\"已复制\"></button><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code\" v-pre=\"\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">typeof</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"> // \"number\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">typeof</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77\"> '</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"> // \"string\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">typeof</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\"> true</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"> // \"boolean\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">typeof</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\"> Symbol</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"> // \"symbol\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">typeof</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999